# Team Pulse — keep secrets, PII, and local state out of git.
# (Single-user tool; see CLAUDE.md "Hard rules" + "Privacy Posture".)

# ── Secrets & PII — the REAL configs live only on your machine ──────────────
#   config.json : Apps Script secret + URL, Google Chat webhook (key+token), IDs
#   team.json   : teammate PII (names, GitHub logins, Jira account IDs)
# Commit the *.example.json templates instead → copy to the real name and fill in.
config.json
team.json

# ── Per-day run logs (contain names + ticket/PR content) ────────────────────
*.log

# ── Claude Code local / session state (machine-specific, not shared) ────────
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/projects/
.claude/todos/
.claude/shell-snapshots/

# ── OS / editor cruft ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
